[RUNNING]● Message: **Implementation**
- Added the catalog-specific DelayedJob plumbing and scheduler so imports/exports enqueue at DEFAULT priority, pick up feature flags, and are drained every 15s/30s without blocking HTTP threads (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/CatalogJobService.java:79-185`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/jobs/CatalogJobScheduler.java:14-74`).
- Reworked the import handler to batch-parse rows, enforce schema/slug/type validation unless explicitly skipped, log row-level failures, and reuse the catalog service for idempotent upserts with tenant-scoped metrics (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/jobs/CatalogImportJobHandler.java:90-220`). Repository pagination helpers were added for exports (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/repositories/ProductRepository.java:48-101`).
- Export jobs now paginate through the repository, stream to a temp file before uploading to R2/MinIO, enforce CSV-only payloads, and emit row counts for observability (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/jobs/CatalogExportJobHandler.java:82-175`).
- `/api/v1/admin/catalog/import|export` endpoints were introduced with typed problem responses and format validation, and the OpenAPI spec gained matching schemas/paths for operator automation (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/CatalogAdminResource.java:436-520`, `modules/core-platform/api/v1/openapi.yaml:120-250`, `modules/core-platform/api/v1/openapi.json`).
- Job catalog documentation now captures payload schemas, new processing cadence notes, and links to the CSV template placed under `docs/templates/catalog-import-sample.csv:1` (`docs/architecture/async/job-catalog.md:90-247`). `.codemachine/artifacts/tasks/tasks_I2.json:45-74` marks I2.T5 as complete.
- Added focused unit tests that verify import batching/upserts and export streaming via the stub storage client (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/jobs/CatalogImportJobHandlerTest.java:70-146`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/jobs/CatalogExportJobHandlerTest.java:70-108`).

